    "reference": "Independent rational decoding of retained knots, values, events and period alongside units, version and stamp, at tolerance 0. Distinct identical preparation owners compare equal; issuer, generation and 2^-200 value changes are refused.",
    "resource": "Forecast costs four wrapper visits and does not allocate. Original owned storage is transferred at the same addresses. Exactly one extra ResourcePlan payload is charged; the separate shared-control allocation is admitted by an estimate. A proven metadata bound, an insufficient opaque estimate, insufficient work and insufficient payload are refused without allocating.",
